# DreamCalendars — Project

Classic PHP calendar site at `public_html/`. No framework — `config.php`, `connection.php`, includes pattern.

## Layout

```
public_html/
├── connection.php     # mysqli — ana site DB (dreamcalendars_dream)
├── config.php         # site config, memcache refs
├── index.php          # homepage
├── month.php, year.php, blank-calendar.php, …
├── printable/         # büyük içerik dizini (~1.2 GB sunucuda)
├── apps/              # mini uygulamalar
├── SaveCalendars/     # ayrı app — dreamcalendars_app DB
├── templates/
├── css/, js/, images/
└── api/
```

## DB

| Site bölümü | DB | Config |
|-------------|-----|--------|
| Ana site | `dreamcalendars_dream` | `connection.php` |
| SaveCalendars | `dreamcalendars_app` | `SaveCalendars/app/db_connection.php` |

